2.COUNT DIGITS IN A NUMBER 
Given a number n, return the count of digits in this number.
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            public static int countDigits(int n) {
                int count=0;
                while(n>0){
                    int rem=n%10;
                    count++;
                    n/=10;
                }
                return count;
            }
        }
