3.THIRD LARGEST 
Given an array, arr[] of positive integers. Find the third largest element in it. Return -1 if the third largest element is not found.
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            public int thirdLargest(List<Integer> arr) {
                int n=arr.size();
                if(n<3){
                    return -1;
                }
                Collections.sort(arr);
                return arr.get(n-3);
            }
        }
